{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33836","headline":"奉和鲁望樵人十咏 樵歌 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望樵人十咏 樵歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此曲太古音，由来无管奏。\n多云采樵乐，或说林泉候。\n一唱凝闲云，再谣悲顾兽。\n若遇采诗人，诬辞收鄙陋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}